# Changelog

## 0.6.2 - 2026-08-30
* Preview Only mode works
* Voice input uses phone mic in preview mode
* Simulated ring input on phone screen is swipe-style rather than separate buttons
* Simulated watch input on phone screen is more minimalist
* Fix an issue where you could be missing the EvenHub font after skipping onboarding
* Terminal app has an activity indicator based on last-output-at tracking

## 0.6.1 - 2026-08-30
* Settings import/export scripts work on release builds
* Fixed an issue where the onboarding flow failed to detect the existing glasses firmware version
* Update launcher, files, and game UIs to work better with watch input
* Calendar app shows the day-of-the-month in its icon
* Move Roam settings out of the shared Settings app and into the Roam app itself

## 0.6 - 2026-08-29
- Start keeping a changelog and making signed binaries via GitHub Releases

